<title>USA: EMERGENCY WEATHER CONDITIONS -  WSC - 25-MAR					     .</title>
<headline>EMERGENCY WEATHER CONDITIONS -  WSC - 25-MAR					     .</headline>
<text>
<p>Tropical Cyclone Justin is nearly dissipated to the east of southern Australia. Top winds of 30 mph may cause a few problems ships in the area for the next 6-12 hours.  </p>
<p>There are no further emergency statements at this time.  </p>
<p>There are no further emergency statements at this time.</p>
